CHGame Player

This repository's own code (libretro/libretro.c, libretro/android_shim.c,
android/, tools/, build scripts) is MIT licensed, see LICENSE.

It includes:

- emu/: CHGame Emulator by joyrider3774, MIT licence (emu/LICENSE),
  https://github.com/joyrider3774/chgame_emulator, unchanged at the commit in
  EMULATOR_VERSION.txt. All of the emulation is theirs.
- The CHGame bootloader embedded in the emulator (MIT), from CHGame by
  Kevin Bates (Apache-2.0).
- libretro/libretro.h from libretro-common, by the RetroArch team (MIT-style
  licence in the file).

- android/assets/fonts/PressStart2P-Regular.ttf: Press Start 2P by CodeMan38, SIL Open
  Font License 1.1 (android/assets/fonts/OFL.txt). The app shows game names in it.

CHGame (the handheld, its platform and its bootloaders) is by Kevin Bates
(bateske), https://chgame.website, Apache-2.0. Each game's credits are in its
own .CHG and are shown by the app.
